{"3115480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Diviner", "steam_appid": 3115480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/62fc3213454cc9e3773170e82a893be7.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/ebd6c41288974179f2c145a963a0204a.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/ebd6c41288974179f2c145a963a0204a.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/ebd6c41288974179f2c145a963a0204a.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore perilous dungeons and abandoned cities filled with useful gear and constant danger in an <strong>isometric third person perspective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/22621c4468004e29acc8b44d4fb2a10a.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/a69801b4298af0ebc0eb5e622de7e366.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/a69801b4298af0ebc0eb5e622de7e366.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/a69801b4298af0ebc0eb5e622de7e366.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in first person turn based combat against a <strong>variety of dangerous enemies</strong>. Skills are rerolled after each use, so <strong>Sequencing</strong> your skills is key to leaving combat unscathed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/081b8460a14d4e332b830dfeea1e7299.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/521c489e5e8170baaee3358ba9a5e136.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/521c489e5e8170baaee3358ba9a5e136.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/521c489e5e8170baaee3358ba9a5e136.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>strategic builds</strong> by selecting which Tether weapons to wield, then add skills to them and form a network of powerful <strong>Affixes</strong> that modify your Tethers and skills to ensure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/717217a6eb1fe0c182dde2eb3d7ca267.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/8531cc601ebcbbbcf4e8c89ee3e9590b.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/8531cc601ebcbbbcf4e8c89ee3e9590b.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/8531cc601ebcbbbcf4e8c89ee3e9590b.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance and <strong>Upgrade</strong> your gear at the Blacksmith. Every <strong>Tether</strong> weapon has a unique passive that changes your gameplay, and you may <strong>Modify</strong> your weapons to suit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/29357d8a2563070d0e99bd2e5bbe2eed.avif?t=1779387368\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras_big/29357d8a2563070d0e99bd2e5bbe2eed.avif?t=1779387368 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/f8e438f41a3bce30d6449fb2b53ca67c.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/f8e438f41a3bce30d6449fb2b53ca67c.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/f8e438f41a3bce30d6449fb2b53ca67c.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will sometimes come across dig sites where the earth shakes. <strong>Excavate</strong> these sites to receive <strong>random loot</strong> to help upgrade your build and add to your strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/ba06b4bda8e5a000194b41a7c5a7196d.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/1b48aebb966e50c13408573579ccd886.poster.avif?t=1779387368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/1b48aebb966e50c13408573579ccd886.webm?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/1b48aebb966e50c13408573579ccd886.mp4?t=1779387368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter characters at the caravan hub, or out in the wild. Utilize them for their services while <strong>learning about their past and future</strong>, and in turn, discover the <strong>dark history of the Lords</strong> and their impact on the lands. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/62fc3213454cc9e3773170e82a893be7.avif?t=1779387368\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" styl